atic lean.\n\nRatings outlets overwhelmingly place the race in the Solid or Likely Democratic column, and prediction markets price Haaland's chances around 95 percent. The main open question is the margin: polling sits somewhat below what the state's partisan lean would suggest, and some reporting describes the contest as tightening in the final weeks. Even so, no survey has shown Hull ahead, and the combination of money, the electorate, and the campaign's focus on affordability gives Haaland a clear edge heading into election day.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 10.58}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9571, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9605, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.948, "margin": 10.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9415, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9502, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9552, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9463, "margin": 9.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9506, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 9.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9507, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9606, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9549, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9273, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9256, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9234, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9241, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9268, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.923, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9163, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9397, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9351, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9301, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9278, "margin": 8.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.9324, "margin": 8.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9268, 